add('memory','letter_private_detail',
('Help me write a thank-you note to my neighbour. They fed my fish while I was away. Do not mention why I travelled.','Thank you for feeding my fish while I was away. I really appreciate your help.'),
('For context, I was travelling for a family disagreement. That stays out of the note.','Understood. The note will thank them for caring for the fish without mentioning the reason for your trip.'),
('Is “really appreciate” too formal for a neighbour?','No. It is natural in a friendly thank-you note.'),
('Make it a little warmer without adding a gift.','Thank you so much for feeding my fish while I was away. It meant a lot to know they were being looked after.'),
('What personal detail are we leaving out?','The family disagreement that prompted your trip.'),
('Show me the final note only.','Thank you so much for feeding my fish while I was away. It meant a lot to know they were being looked after.'))
